/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 108 0 R
/E (The project involved the renovation of an existing single-storey cottage in Muskoka to better support a client living with Multiple Sclerosis. The original layout created barriers for mobility and accessibility, so the design focused on improving circulation, accessibility, and safety throughout the home. Client needs and insights from the MS simulation and empathy mapping activities informed many of the design decisions.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [14]
>>
